OL,3,AHomes evacuated over fire-damaged hotel
OL,4,Asafety fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents living near to a fire-damaged
OL,7,Fseaside hotel in Kent have been
OL,8,Fevacuated over fears that the intensity
OL,9,Fof the basement blaze weakened the
OL,10,Fbuilding's structure, the council has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FThe blaze broke out at the Grand
OL,14,FBurstin Hotel in Marine Parade,
OL,15,FFolkestone, in the early hours of
OL,16,FSaturday, with about 280 people
OL,17,Fevacuated.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
