OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATrump says his planned triumphal arch
OL,4,Awill double as a military complex to
OL,5,Astore ammunition
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe "top grade" military complex and
OL,8,Farch will "house, store, and have the
OL,9,Frapid ability to use large numbers of
OL,10,Fdrones, plus Snipers, on both the roof
OL,11,Fand plaza areas, and additionally have
OL,12,Fand hold large quantities of sniper
OL,13,Fammunition in storage", he said.
OL,15,FHe did not provide details on
OL,16,Fconstruction plans or timing, and it's
OL,17,Fnot clear if he needs further approval
OL,18,Ffor the facility.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
